  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tirh](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tirh) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 116.019 depth occurred on Sep 20 2026 13km SE of Guhu. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -5.7711 longitude 146.2041. It impacted 79915 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
